+
+\f0\fs24 \cf0 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::1>
+\f1\b\fs48 6. Final domestic sequence\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+
+\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::1>
+\f2 This is the payoff section.\
+It should be spacious enough to breathe but not sentimental.\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0
+
+\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
+\f1\b\fs36 Exercise bike transformed\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+
+\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
+\f2 Pin Cushion is on the same bike.\
+The contrast with Section 1 should be obvious without being explained.\
+Now:\
+\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+\ls1\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 resistance is meaningful;\
+\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 cadence is easy and sustained;\
+\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 hips stay stable;\
+\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 proximal fatigue does not arrive as expected;\
+\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 she can talk while pedalling;\
+\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 she may turn the resistance up herself;\
+\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 she may now regard the stationary bike as boring because she wants a real one.\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+\cf0 \strokec2 The achievement is 
+\f1\b normal competence
+\f2\b0 , not superhuman performance.\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0
+
+\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
+\f1\b\fs36 No more needles\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+
+\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
+\f2 Janine tells her:\
+\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+\ls2\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 the treatment worked;\
+\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 it appears to have stayed;\
+\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 the LGMD should not return in the way they feared;\
+\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 she should not need more TPlus injections.\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+\cf0 \strokec2 This has immediate meaning for Pin Cushion:\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+
+\f1\b \cf0 no more needles.
+\f2\b0 \
+That gives the nickname a quiet second meaning: Pin Cushion has become a piece of personal history rather than an ongoing medical condition.\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0
+
+\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
+\f1\b\fs36 Longevity conversation\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+
+\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
+\f2 Janine must also tell her that the implications extend beyond LGMD.\
+Hermann\'92s TPlus work predicts extraordinarily long healthy lifespan under sustained effect.\
+Because Pin Cushion now appears to have self-sustaining TPlus, Janine believes she may remain healthy for a very long time.\
+Janine must not say:\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+\cf0 \strokec2 You will live to 160.\strokec2 \
+Her honest position:\
+\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+\ls3\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 possibly something in the broad 140\'96160-year territory;\
+\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 maybe less;\
+\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 conceivably more;\
+\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 nobody knows;\
+\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 nobody has ever produced this situation before.\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+\cf0 \strokec2 The important fact is:\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+
+\f1\b \cf0 Pin Cushion may live far longer than an ordinary human life.
+\f2\b0 \
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0
+
+\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
+\f1\b\fs36 Pin Cushion\'92s reaction\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+
+\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
+\f2 Keep it personal, practical and age-specific.\
+She should not suddenly become philosophical because the theme requires it.\
+She may ask:\
+\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+\ls4\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Will I look old?\
+\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Do I get twice as many birthdays?\
+\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 What happens to everyone else?\
+\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 What about you?\
+\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Can you take it too?\
+\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Do I still have school tomorrow?\
+\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Does this mean she finally gets a real bike?\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+\cf0 \strokec2 The exact choice belongs to the eventual dialogue.\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0
+
+\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
+\f1\b\fs36 The hard question: Janine\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+
+\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
+\f2 If Pin Cushion asks what happens to Janine, Janine cannot promise the same thing.\
+Her daughter\'92s permanent integration arose from the pathological opportunity in LGMD tissue.\
+Ordinary TPlus is not the same.\
+There are larger implications Janine has not yet worked through.\
+She is also due at work.\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0
+
+\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
+\f1\b\fs36 The promise\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+
+\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
+\f2 Janine tells Pin Cushion they will talk properly when she gets home.\
+This is sincere and ordinary.\
+No ominous treatment.\
+No pause.\
+No narrator telling us the promise will not be kept.\
+The reader already knows Janine is about to go to the Pale and die there.\
+That is enough.}
