+\f1\fs22 She eyed it on the kitchen table. \'93That looks expensive.\'94\
+\'93It is.\'94 Janine tried not to think about it.\
+\'93Good. I\'92d hate to die from something cheap.\'94 Pin Cushion\'92s smile emerged from grim bravery.\
