+toxic shock;\
+\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+major organ distress;\
+\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+other evidence that Hermann\'92s predicted catastrophic exposure has occurred.\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+\cf0 Nothing catastrophic happens.\
