+\f1\fs22 Dr Janine Anstey cried; whatever she decided, she\'92d be a monster.
+\f2\fs24 \cf0 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 \
+\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
