+\f2 She tells Pin Cushion there is an experimental drug at work.\
+It is TPlus.\
+It has already been through initial human safety work, but it remains a trial drug.\
+Janine\'92s immediate medical proposition is not:\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+\cf0 \strokec2 I can permanently rewrite you.\strokec2 \
+It is:\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+
+\f1\b \cf0 Pin Cushion\'92s diseased muscle may allow Janine to use much larger local doses than would normally be contemplated, with the prospect of deeper and faster therapeutic repair.
+\f2\b0 \
+That is the rational treatment case even if permanent integration never occurs.\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0
+
+\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
+\f1\b\fs36 Why LGMD creates the opportunity\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+
+\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
+\f2 Janine explains, only as far as necessary:\
+\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+\ls2\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Pin Cushion\'92s muscle is undergoing continual damage and repair.\
+\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 TPlus is unusually effective at repairing damaged tissue.\
+\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Hermann\'92s work says TPlus normally remains separate from the chromosomes.\
+\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 In unusual circumstances, foreign material can be incorporated during DNA repair.\
+\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Hermann regards permanent incorporation as effectively unusable because the concentrations required systemically should be lethally toxic.\
+\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Janine believes the diseased muscle creates a different situation.\
+\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 She can place a very high concentration of TPlus 
+\f1\b directly into damaged muscle
+\f2\b0 , where repair is already happening, without producing the same concentration throughout the body.\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+\cf0 \strokec2 This is Janine\'92s assessment.\
+Not authorial certainty.\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0
+
+\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
+\f1\b\fs36 The zipper\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+
+\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
+\f2 Pin Cushion turns the explanation into a zipper.\
+The zipper belongs to her.\
+Something like the conceptual sequence:\
+\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+\ls3\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 her muscle/DNA keeps breaking;\
+\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 her body keeps repairing the broken zipper;\
+\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Janine wants to put a new piece right beside the break;\
+\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 if the repair machinery grabs the TPlus while fixing the break, the new piece may stay in the zipper.\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+\cf0 \strokec2 Janine knows the analogy is crude.\
+It is useful, so she accepts it.\
+The zipper becomes their shared language for the gamble.\
+Do not overuse it.\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0
+
+\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
+\f1\b\fs36 Risks Janine must explain\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+
+\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
+\f2 Pin Cushion is old enough to participate meaningfully.\
+Janine tells her:\
+\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+\ls4\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 TPlus is experimental;\
+\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 this use is outside the normal trial protocol;\
+\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Janine is proposing unusually high local doses;\
+\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Hermann\'92s modelling predicts that excessive exposure can produce catastrophic systemic toxicity;\
+\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Janine believes local delivery into diseased muscle changes that risk;\
+\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 she does not know that for certain;\
+\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Pin Cushion could become extremely ill;\
+\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 she could die;\
+\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 the treatment may improve the LGMD but do nothing permanent;\
+\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 the permanent integration possibility is precisely that: a possibility.\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+\cf0 \strokec2 No soft-pedalling.\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0
+
+\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
+\f1\b\fs36 Pin Cushion\'92s questions\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+
+\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
+\f2 Her questions should remain practical and age-specific.\
+Likely territory:\
+\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+\ls5\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 How many injections?\
+\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Where?\
+\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 How big are the needles?\
+\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 How much will it hurt?\
+\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Are you allowed to do this?\
+\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 What happens if it goes wrong?\
+\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Does Janine actually know what she is doing?\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
+\cf0 \strokec2 No mini science seminar.\
+\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0
+
