+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 the permanent-integration possibility;\
+\ls6\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
+\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 the risk;\
